OL,3,GNEWSAJury sworn in for trial of husband
OL,4,Aaccused of drugging and raping wife
OL,5,Awith 12 others
OL,6,
OL,7,FA jury has been sworn in for the trial
OL,8,Fof a man accused of drugging and raping
OL,9,Fhis wife for almost 20 years before
OL,10,Fallegedly inviting other men to join
OL,11,Fthe abuse.
OL,13,FThe husband, who cannot be named to
OL,14,Fprotect his wife's legal right to
OL,15,Fanonymity, has already admitted 15
OL,16,Fcharges including rape.
OL,18,FHowever he denies 33 other counts and
OL,19,Fwill stand trial alongside 12 other men
OL,20,Fat Minshull Street Crown Court in
OL,21,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
